00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:04.759
So we just want to click this pillar here of inputs

72
00:03:04.759 --> 00:03:07.699
and you just want to, on the left-hand side here,

73
00:03:07.699 --> 00:03:08.919
you'll see that we've got

74
00:03:08.919 --> 00:03:11.800
a light function material set up here

75
00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:14.360
and that just makes sure it casts shadows.

76
00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.240
You want to make sure that that's enabled.

77
00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.960
And then we can call up the material function in the graph

78
00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.340
