83
00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:38.639
So by default, you'll just create a material function

84
00:03:38.639 --> 00:03:41.120
and then plug in the specific function

85
00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.280
that you want into that node,

86
00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.439
